  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can meditate to gain additional customizations.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Extra Customization.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Each day, you can take 1 hour of meditation to decide how to focus your mythic energies. At the end of this time, you gain one additional customization point to spend. You retain this customization point until you next meditate on your mythic customizations.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc19\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
